WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:15.779
Bello: You can really see far from up here.

2
00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.817
Tina: Hey, look over there.

3
00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:22.059
It’s my wagon.

4
00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:25.059
Bello: And isn’t that your neighbor, Mrs. Rice?

5
00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:30.868
Tina: I wonder what she is looking for.

6
00:00:30.869 --> 00:00:32.632
Bello: Did you see that!

7
00:00:32.633 --> 00:00:35.046
Tina: It must have been the shrink-gun.

8
00:00:35.047 --> 00:00:37.119
Somebody found it.

9
00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.829
Bello: Great! Let’s go see.

10
00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:51.021
Tina: Follow me.

11
00:00:51.022 --> 00:00:53.426
Danny: Help! Help!

12
00:00:53.427 --> 00:00:55.917
Brad: We’re stuck!

13
00:00:55.918 --> 00:00:58.429
Dave: That sounds like Danny and Brad.

14
00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:06.994
Chuck: It sounds like they’re over here.

15
00:01:06.995 --> 00:01:09.838
Dave: Hey, what happened to you guys?

16
00:01:09.839 --> 00:01:11.853
Danny: What do you think happened?

17
00:01:11.854 --> 00:01:14.598
We got caught in a web.

18
00:01:14.599 --> 00:01:17.680
Chuck: I don’t see a spider anywhere.

19
00:01:17.681 --> 00:01:19.947
Brad: Yes, but we’re still stuck.

20
00:01:19.948 --> 00:01:24.880
Get us out.

21
00:01:24.881 --> 00:01:27.838
Danny: This spider web is really sticky.

22
00:01:27.839 --> 00:01:29.491
Dave: I’ve got an idea.

23
00:01:29.492 --> 00:01:32.267
Let’s take off their shoes.

24
00:01:32.268 --> 00:01:35.249
Brad: This is not the time to tease us.

25
00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:43.134
Dave: We’re not. This is going to help.

26
00:01:43.135 --> 00:01:45.976
Chuck: Okay, your feet are unstuck.

27
00:01:45.977 --> 00:01:48.422
Dave: See, I told you this would help.

28
00:01:48.423 --> 00:01:50.381
Danny: Now what?

29
00:01:50.382 --> 00:02:01.298
Dave: We pull!

30
00:02:01.299 --> 00:02:02.878
Tina: What’s going on?

31
00:02:02.879 --> 00:02:05.378
Were you fighting again?

32
00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:07.621
Brad: No, we weren’t fighting.

33
00:02:07.622 --> 00:02:10.284
We were stuck in a spider web.

34
00:02:10.285 --> 00:02:15.053
Danny: They helped us get free. Thanks.

35
00:02:15.054 --> 00:02:17.577
Chuck: Glad to help.

36
00:02:17.578 --> 00:02:19.774
Bello: We saw a big flash.

37
00:02:19.775 --> 00:02:22.033
Did you find the shrink-gun?

38
00:02:22.034 --> 00:02:25.124
Danny: Yes, but it disappeared.

39
00:02:25.125 --> 00:02:29.726
Dave: Eww, a spider.

40
00:02:29.727 --> 00:02:32.108
Brad: Did you just squish a spider? Let me see.

41
00:02:34.943 --> 00:02:39.251
Brad: We’re tiny, but that spider is really, really tiny.

42
00:02:39.252 --> 00:02:43.134
Brad: I think I know what happened.

43
00:02:43.135 --> 00:02:46.038
Chuck: Does he always get so excited?

44
00:02:46.039 --> 00:02:49.211
Danny: Only when he has a really smart idea.

45
00:02:49.212 --> 00:02:50.839
Brad: I found it!

46
00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:52.728
Everybody, come here!

47
00:02:52.729 --> 00:02:56.557
I found it!

48
00:02:56.558 --> 00:02:58.657
Tina: It’s the shrink-gun!

49
00:02:58.658 --> 00:03:00.162
Bello: It shrunk!

50
00:03:00.163 --> 00:03:02.725
Brad: Yes, that’s what happened.

51
00:03:02.726 --> 00:03:05.532
The spider was pulling at the nano-putty.

52
00:03:05.533 --> 00:03:11.818
Brad: The shrink-gun fired, and it shrunk the spider and the gun.

53
00:03:11.819 --> 00:03:15.744
Chuck: Great! We’ll all be back to normal soon.

54
00:03:15.745 --> 00:03:20.544
Brad: I’ll check . . . Oh no . . .

55
00:03:20.545 --> 00:03:23.479
Danny: What’s the matter?

56
00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:26.066
Brad: No, it’s not going to work.

57
00:03:26.067 --> 00:03:27.740
Danny: Why not?

58
00:03:27.741 --> 00:03:32.397
Brad: The nano-putty is gone!
